      "widgets_values": [
        "Global Metadata: Bright J-pop, anime opening style. 150 BPM, E major. Energetic and hopeful, building to a big final chorus. Polished modern anime soundtrack production, wide stereo.\n\nVocal Details: Clear bright female lead vocal, confident and emotional, stacked harmonies in the chorus.\n\nArrangement: Driving electric guitars, bouncy bass, fast pop drums, sparkling piano and synth bells, string stabs in the chorus. Intro: piano and guitar riff. Chorus: full band with strings. Outro: guitar riff rings out.",
        "[Intro]\n\n[Verse]\nRunning through the morning light\nEvery window shining bright\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nHold on, hold on to the sky\n\n[Chorus]\nWe're flying higher than before\nOpen every closing door\nSing it louder, never stop\nWe'll make it to the top\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Chorus]\nWe're flying higher than before\nOpen every closing door\nSing it louder, never stop\nWe'll make it to the top\n\n[Outro]\n",
        120.0,
        "minimax_music3_dit_fp16.safetensors",
